OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening for most although patchy rain
OL,7,Flingering in some northern areas. A
OL,8,Fband of heavy rain sweeps through
OL,9,Fquickly overnight, only leaving
OL,10,Fshowers in the east by dawn. Very
OL,11,Fstrong winds, turning to gales at the
OL,12,Fcoast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FA bright and breezy day with
OL,15,Fplenty of sunny spells, although
OL,16,Ffurther isolated showers bubble up
OL,17,Fthrough the morning. Feeling fresh in
OL,18,Fthe strong breeze, this easing through
OL,19,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
