OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells and easing winds
OL,7,FWednesday. Overnight cloud or fog
OL,8,Fclears to sunny spells and light winds
OL,9,FThursday, then cloud starts to build
OL,10,Fagain later on Friday.
